WEBVTT

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.890
<i>I'm pretty sure it was around here...</i>

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.370
No fair, Sou-kun!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.370
No fair, Souta-kun!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.370
No fair, Souta!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.110
No fair, Souta-kun!

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:20.940
Did you have to say that, too, Akane?

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:21.620
I just felt like it, really.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:22.500
My name's Ruri.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.750
What type of joke was that?

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.240
What?

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.310
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:02.970
<b>Flag 5</b>

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:02.970
<b>Believe and Wait for Me. 
I'm not Going to be Late for My Date With Everyone.</b>

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:06.010
So can I ask you something?

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:07.560
Sure. Whatever you want.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.230
W-Well...

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:13.480
I really want to go out somewhere 
with you, even if only just once.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.640
Sure, that shouldn't be a problem.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:25.130
I guess you did say okay,

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:25.990
but...

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:28.180
I can't believe you kept a secret like that

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.170
from your sister, Sou-kun.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.040
I-I'm sorry!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.210
I'm a thieving cat, a homewrecker.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.300
Cats are cute!

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.570
We can all just accompany him.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.740
Akane wasn't the only one who put 
in long hours for the track meet.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.680
We all did.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.430
That's a good idea!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.640
I see!

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.230
That means you should come 
with us, too, Nanami.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:54.250
Let's go, Nanami-chan.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:56.350
Huh? I'm good...

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:59.970
I'm impressed you were able to include 
yourself as part of the date today

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:01.430
just like that, Nanami-san.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.240
No!

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:05.740
I didn't want this at all!

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.830
Okay, now we're going to decide who 
gets to be with Souta-kun first!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.260
Yeah!

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.580
I'm totally not going!

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:20.220
We've figured out who's going when. 
Hurry up and get ready.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:23.160
Also, I'm not going.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.720
I'm totally not!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.630
Did you have to say that twice?

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.470
Ruri isn't going, either, supposedly.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:31.730
She's looking into something, I guess.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:34.210
I see.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.060
That's that, I guess.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:40.280
Anyway, I guess I'll go have fun today.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:42.030
Oh, no!

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.030
How careless of me.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.620
Oh, yes, I may be staying here today,

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.580
but you don't need to get me 
anything while you're out.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:56.170
Especially these limited-time only cakes. 
I don't need them!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.520
I don't need them at all!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.230
Why are you saying everything twice?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:09.530
Megumu!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.770
Sorry, I guess I'm a little late.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.760
No, I just got here.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:17.360
I'm going to be a man today 
and escort you around.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.110
She's pulling her boyfriend everywhere.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.610
Must be nice to be on a first date.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.000
Souta always finds a way into trouble,

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.460
and Akane and the others are 
always doing something silly,

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.580
but they're all gone today!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.090
I'm the queen of the Quest Dorm right now!

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:43.800
I can do this and no one can stop me!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.900
We didn't get it again.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.740
This is harder than I thought.

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.210
Souta-kun...

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:12.070
Huh?

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.360
You did it, Souta-kun!

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.610
Souta-kun?

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.440
<i>I began to see flags,</i>

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.240
<i>not only on on humans, but on other things, too.</i>

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.760
<i>There must be something at Quest Dorm...</i>

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.660
Souta-kun!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.430
Souta-kun!

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:57.680
S-Sorry, Megumu.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.730
You wanted this, right?

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:02.000
Yeah, thanks.

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:05.750
It's so cute.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.140
Oh, yeah.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:09.890
We should go someplace you 
want to next, as thanks.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:12.300
Hm, what do I want...

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.920
Oh, I guess I'm kind of hungry.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:19.720
Then I know a good place!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:22.690
It's very manly, with extra-large portions!

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.240
Megumu, what's this supposed to be...

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:34.490
It's a super-special parfait 
that no one has ever finished.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.750
Now show off your manliness and eat it all!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:50.000
I don't think this is going 
to work, man or not.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.150
I'm so full...

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.000
Told you.

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.330
I'm so full?

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:05.690
Fine. I'll help you out.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.360
Yep!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:11.160
Friendship is when you 
fight your battles together!

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:24.980
There's some cream on your face.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.300
What? Really?

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.010
No, a little more to your right.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.980
I can't get it.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.510
Oh, jeez... Get it for me, Souta-kun!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.680
<i>Is everyone here an idiot?</i>

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:56.860
Souta-kun, hurry.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.000
Thank you, Souta-kun.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.760
<b>Yakisoba</b>

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.800
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:23.430
No. I've been waiting 
for you all my life.

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:24.350
You waited that long?!

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.860
It's Akane's turn now!

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:34.810
This is my first time going 
somewhere with a boy,

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:39.310
so I asked my father and mother what to do.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:40.580
Asked them?

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:44.830
My father told me this place would be great.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:45.790
Hm?

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:49.680
Okay, here we are!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.290
This is surprisingly normal.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:55.770
My father said that any couple 
that got on these boats

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:58.950
would definitely break up, 
so they're perfect.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:00.770
I get it now.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.100
Anyway, about that.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:10.360
We're not a couple, so I don't 
suspect there will be a problem.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:14.170
Actually, since we're not a couple,

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:17.420
then we'll never leave each other's side.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.870
I never thought about that.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:23.520
Of course, I'd like for us 
to be a couple someday.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.130
T-Time for me to show you my 
authentic Italian boating skills.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.130
Paddle.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.800
Paddle. Paddle.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.140
I'll concede that was impressive, 
but something seems off here!

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:44.640
You mean like we're in the wrong 
timezone and I'm Japanese?

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.560
Yeah, I guess you could say that...

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:49.900
Anyway, let's paddle together. 
Yeah, that's best.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.560
You mean we get to work 
together, the two of us?!

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:56.900
Let me know if I do something weird!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.410
I'll take one paddle, 
and you get the other one.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.500
Akane!

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:13.970
Are you okay, Akane?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:16.110
Yeah.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.240
Is something wrong, Akane?

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.550
I...

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:32.930
Thank you.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.720
Y-Yeah...

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.860
A-Akane!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:40.900
Yes?

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:49.110
M-My mom told me to

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:51.830
wear my good underwear, so I...

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:54.830
<i>What is your mom teaching you?!</i>

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:57.050
Did I do good? Did I do bad?

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.800
Who cares?! We just need to 
get your clothes dry!

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:03.430
I guess we should go somewhere 
where there won't be any people.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:06.320
I have an idea...

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:11.350
It's so fun by myself.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.910
I can eat and sleep as much as I want!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.060
There really isn't anyone here.

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:20.000
It's always been like this.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:20.780
Huh?

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.770
Not many people come here.

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:27.300
That's why I got to be such 
good friends with her so fast.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:29.510
Wait... Is this where...

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.520
I wanted to come here with you at least once.

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:37.730
Not too long ago I couldn't 
even come close to here,

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.550
but now I'm fine.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:44.290
You said that nothing can happen to me

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:46.830
until I see her again.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.300
I haven't run into her again yet,

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:52.810
but I did meet you, 
and have become close to you.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.450
Akane...

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:57.510
That's why I want to thank both of you,

00:11:57.510 --> 00:11:59.030
you and her.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.310
Maybe I should be the one saying that.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.640
S-Souta.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.500
Oh, Rin-kun?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.350
Okiku made me wear this.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:30.020
I bet this frilly stuff 
doesn't look good on me.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.590
I know you think so...

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:38.150
<i>A yandere flag!</i>

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.400
N-No, it looks good on you!

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:42.610
R-Really?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.400
Y-Yeah.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.410
You're really cute.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:47.910
<b>Cleared</b>

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:53.390
<i>She's too easy...</i>

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:56.960
It's great how quiet it is!

00:12:57.490 --> 00:13:00.640
I wish it was this quiet all the time!

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:05.130
It's been a while since I could 
just sit back like this.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.840
It's been kind of busy lately.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:12.010
Let's do something tomorrow, too.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.190
Sure.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.790
Looking at them brings back memories.

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:16.850
Yeah.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.200
We were always together.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:23.010
Oh, yeah, I forgot I have this.

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.810
Oh, this brings back memories.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.260
So you brought these for me.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:35.030
Every day was so much fun back then.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:38.310
I wish life could've stayed that way.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:39.490
Souta...

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:42.340
Don't look at me like that.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.840
I'm having tons of fun right now, too.

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:45.760
Oh.

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:47.760
Rin-kun, you remember this?

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:50.700
Yeah, I remember.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:54.180
That was when we took on the 
bathhouse's chimney and won.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.360
Speaking of which...

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.050
We did it, Souta!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:01.010
Yeah, I'm glad we made it 
to the top before I moved.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:07.700
S-Souta... I...

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.480
Anyway, to commemorate this moment,

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:10.960
I say we have a pissing contest.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.080
Wh-What are you saying?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.580
What? You scared of losing?

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:20.280
Fine. You're on.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.710
On your mark...

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:30.110
You idiot!

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.850
R-Rin-kun, what's up?

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:35.920
I-I know we were kids, b-but still...

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.520
All right! You're a man, take responsibility.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.310
R-Responsibility for what?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.610
You know exactly what I mean!

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:47.250
Y-You know...

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:50.610
Rin-kun?!

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.370
Hey— Rin-kun?!

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.790
O-Okiku-nee...

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:00.870
Sou-ku—

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:02.520
Hm?

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.890
You all want to go somewhere with me?

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:18.390
I can go with you if you really insist.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.530
We're back.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:27.690
Hm?

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:34.690
I'm back.

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:37.510
Rin-chan'll be fine once she gets a little rest.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:38.700
I'm glad.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.190
Sorry.

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.540
There might not be enough time 
to go somewhere with you now.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.550
It's fine.

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:45.280
But...

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:46.200
Oh, right.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:50.720
If you're really upset about it, 
then sleep on my lap for a bit.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:55.220
Normally it's the guy who asks that.

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:58.720
I really like that.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.730
Okiku-nee, that's...

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.900
Oh, this?

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.540
You remembered.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.740
Of course I did.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.690
What's wrong, Okiku-chan?

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:23.790
I...

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:26.040
I want to be a big sister.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.910
But now I can't...

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.570
Okiku-chan.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.210
Sou-kun?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:44.850
This is important to me, 
and I'll give it to you.

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:48.330
And... And...

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:53.040
I'll... I'll be your little brother.

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:55.460
Sou-kun...

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.460
I can't be your little brother?

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.560
No, you can.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:03.890
I'm...

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:05.790
I'm really happy.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.390
But...

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:10.850
Then will you call me "oneechan"?

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:11.670
Sure.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.160
Okiku-neechan!

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.800
Thank you, Sou-kun!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.740
You know, I haven't been that great.

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:25.100
I really haven't be a good little 
brother character for you.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:28.850
I keep telling you, you're not 
a "little brother character,"

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:30.860
you're actually my little brother.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.270
Yeah, that's true.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.490
<i>My real sister got mad at me for</i>

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.720
<i>being someone else's little brother,</i>

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:44.000
<i>but both of them are important to me.</i>

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.330
You're so cute!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.130
I love you so much!

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.380
<b>Women</b>

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.620
I had a great day.

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:55.630
It was so much fun.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.890
I had Quest Dorm all to myself.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:01.070
That's great.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:03.430
I think it was bad of us to go off

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.890
and have fun without you.

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:07.420
Yeah.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:11.270
You let us have your time with Souta.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:14.220
I'm impressed by your kindness.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:15.780
Hm? Yeah.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:21.200
<i>It's amazing how far Souta's come.</i>

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.880
I never thought he'd be going on dates 
with girls on his days off.

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:32.840
Is something wrong?

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.170
No, nothing at all.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:38.590
You guys haven't forgotten, have you?

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.660
Hm?

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:42.610
You know, don't you? 
Souta told you all, I'm sure.

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:45.600
While I was watching 
the house, you know...

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.190
We know... what?

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:55.860
Souta and all of you suck!

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.410
Huh? I guess I was hearing things?

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:04.760
Souta-san.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.980
I have a report on the 
underground passageway.

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:09.490
Right.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:15.540
I have concluded that the passageway exists.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:17.840
However, according to my ground scans,

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.230
it seems the passageway was buried.

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.370
I see.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:25.970
So I... dug it again.

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.060
What?!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:34.210
I couldn't call myself an android 
if I didn't have a drill or two.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:38.500
You have everything, don't you, Ruri?

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.150
We're here.

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:48.260
So this is the First Gate.

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:54.000
The truth of the world might be... 
behind this door.

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:07.380
There's nothing here.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.980
Knight, magician,

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.070
bishop, ninja...

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.040
The same as the letter.

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.340
I don't really recognize the others.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:25.400
I cannot scan the interior.

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:27.540
It seems to be made of a special material.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:31.090
Guess we can't solve the mystery that easily.

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.470
What shall we do with this?

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:35.850
Let's just leave it here for now.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:37.210
Roger that.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:41.180
Okay, let's head back for today.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:42.560
Hm?

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:45.390
So what's over there?

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:46.940
The outside world.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:50.640
I've confirmed it connects to 
the forest behind Quest Dorm.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:54.740
What's this light?!

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:57.470
I believe it's being generated 
by a large amount of energy.

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:59.710
Ruri, watch after the 
people in the dorm.

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:01.150
I'm going to take a look.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.060
What's going on...

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:16.920
I can't say I think very highly

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:19.670
of you messing with this world's flags,

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:25.590
Mr. Enormous Death Flag.

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:12.260
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:15.320
I've been wondering for a while, 
but what's up with that roar thing?

00:23:15.320 --> 00:23:17.230
It's an official greeting.

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:17.900
Official?!

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:20.260
It's not "roar," anyway. It's "gawo!"

00:23:20.260 --> 00:23:21.530
The "wo" from "gawore."

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:23.900
In English letters, it's "w-o."

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:24.710
A very detailed answer!

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:26.420
Now say it with us!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.680
I'm not letting up until you say it.

00:23:27.680 --> 00:23:29.200
I guess this is the "teacher won't let you go

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:30.590
home until you eat all your school lunch flag."

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:31.960
Roar. Gawo.

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Flag 6</b>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Phew. Don't scare me like that. I guess you're just a little sister.</b>

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:32.880
Too quiet!

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:34.160
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>I hope you watch us next time!</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: CHAN X CO
